Even If The Flowers - JWorship (Intro)

2
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:29,000
[1절] 이곳에 생명 샘 솟아나, 눈물 골짝 지나갈 때에
Here the spring of life gushes forth, As we pass through the valley of tears

3
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:40,500
머잖아 열매 맺히고, 웃음 소리 넘쳐나리라
Soon the fruit will bear, And laughter will overflow

4
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:52,000
